        "text": "",
        "speak_cantonese": "\u4eca\u5e74\u6211\u54cb\u53bb\u6b50\u6d32\u65c5\u884c\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "This year we are going to Europe for a trip.",
        "notes": "G\u0101m n\u00echn ng\u00f3h deih heui \u0101u j\u0101u l\u00e9uih h\u00e0hng.\n\n\u4eca\u5e74\u6211\u54cb\u53bb\u6b50\u6d32\u65c5\u884c\u3002\n\n\u4eca\u5e74 is a time noun meaning \u201cthis year\u201d and modifies the whole clause."
