    {
      "id": "cantonese_listening-2026-11-26-yue-0011",
      "front": {
        "text": "",
        "speak_cantonese": "\u6211\u751f\u65e5\u55f0\u65e5\uff0c\u4f62\u9001\u6211\u73ab\u7470\u82b1\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "On my birthday, he gave me roses.",
        "notes": "Ng\u00f3h s\u0101ng yaht g\u00f3 yaht, k\u00e9uih sung ng\u00f3h muih gw\u0101i f\u0101.\n\n\u6211\u751f\u65e5\u55f0\u65e5\uff0c\u4f62\u9001\u6211\u73ab\u7470\u82b1\u3002\n\n\u9001 is a verb meaning \u201cto give (as a gift)\u201d and takes \u6211 as indirect object and \u73ab\u7470\u82b1 as direct object."
      },
      "presentation": "audio_only",
      "available_at": "2026-11-26T16:00:00Z",
