      "front": {
        "text": "",
        "speak_cantonese": "\u6211\u54cb\u53ef\u4ee5\u4ea4\u63db\u5730\u5740\uff0c\u597d\u65b9\u4fbf\u3002",
        "audio": null,
        "image": null
      },
      "back": {
        "text": "We can exchange addresses, which is convenient.",
        "notes": "ng\u00f3h deih h\u00f3 j\u00e1uh g\u0101au wuhn deih j\u00ed, h\u00f3u f\u014dng waih.\n\n\u6211\u54cb\u53ef\u4ee5\u4ea4\u63db\u5730\u5740\uff0c\u597d\u65b9\u4fbf\u3002\n\n\u4ea4\u63db means \u201cto exchange/switch\u201d and is used as a transitive verb here, taking \u201c\u5730\u5740\u201d as its object."
      },
